#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/line.rst:5
msgid "Line"
msgstr "线条"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/line.rst:8
msgid "Create line"
msgstr "创建行"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/line.rst:10
msgid "The line can only be added to `workspace`_ from `toolbar`_."
msgstr "该行只能从 `工作区 <workspace_>`_ 添加到 `工具栏 <toolbar_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/line.rst:12
msgid "Select the icon |icon_line| from `toolbar`_ to add a line."
msgstr "从 `工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ 选择图标 |icon_line| 添加一行 。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/line.rst:16
msgid "icon_line"
msgstr "图标( L)"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/line.rst:13
msgid "Click on the initial point from the line in the `workspace`_."
msgstr "点击 `工作区 <workspace_>`_ 中线的初始点。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/line.rst:14
msgid "Click on the end point from the line in the `workspace`_."
msgstr "点击 `工作区 <workspace_>`_ 中线的终点。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/line.rst:20
msgid ""
"If the `toolbar`_ is not displayed, it can be displayed from **Settings > "
"Display > Parts**."
msgstr "如果 `工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ 不显示，可以从 **设置 > 显示 > 部件** 显示。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/line.rst:23
msgid "Line properties"
msgstr "行属性"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/line.rst:25
msgid ""
"Element part properties can be displayed from `information panel`_ when the "
"part is selected."
msgstr "元素部分属性可以在选择该部分时从 `信息面板 <information panel_>`_ 显示。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/line.rst:30
msgid ""
"If the `information panel`_ is not displayed, it can be displayed from "
"**Settings > Display > Information**."
msgstr "如果 `信息面板 <information panel_>`_ 未显示，可以从 **设置 > 显示 > 信息** 显示。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/line.rst:35
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech line from element"
msgstr "图：来自元素的QElectroTech线"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/line.rst:37
msgid "QElectroTech allows customizing different line properties:"
msgstr "QElectroTech 允许自定义不同行属性："

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/line.rst
msgid "Appearance"
msgstr "外观"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/line.rst
msgid "Color"
msgstr "颜色"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/line.rst:43
msgid ""
"The outline and filling color of the part can be defined from a list of pre-"
"defined colors. At the case of the line part the filling color is **None**."
msgstr "部分的轮廓和填充颜色可以从预定义的颜色列表中定义。在线条部分中，填充颜色是 **None** 。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/line.rst
msgid "Style"
msgstr "样式"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/line.rst:48
msgid ""
"The outline representation type can be chosen between: Normal (Continuous), "
"Dashed, Dotted or, Dots and dashes."
msgstr "大纲表达式类型可以在：正常(持续), Dashed, Dotted 或，Dots 和 dustes 之间选择。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/line.rst
msgid "Thickness"
msgstr "厚度"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/line.rst:53
msgid ""
"The outline thickness (Weight) can be chosen between: None, Thin, Normal, "
"Strong or High."
msgstr "轮廓厚度(重量)可以在：无，细，正常，强或高之间选择。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/line.rst
msgid "Geometry"
msgstr "几何"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/line.rst
msgid "Coordinates"
msgstr "坐标"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/line.rst:60
msgid "The start and end point coordinates (x, y) can be defined."
msgstr "起点和终点坐标(x,y)可以定义。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/line.rst
msgid "End point"
msgstr "终点"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/line.rst:64
msgid "The extreme point from the line can be represented individually as:"
msgstr "该线的极端点可以分别表示为："

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/line.rst
msgid "Normal"
msgstr "常规"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/line.rst:67
msgid ""
"The extreme point is represented as the rest of the line, there is no "
"different representation for the end point."
msgstr "极点作为线的其余部分表示，终点没有不同的表示。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/line.rst
msgid "Simple arrow"
msgstr "简单箭头"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/line.rst:70
msgid "The extreme point is represented as a filled arrow."
msgstr "极点表示为填充箭头。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/line.rst
msgid "Triangle arrow"
msgstr "三角箭头"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/line.rst:72
msgid "The extreme point is represented as an empty triangle arrow."
msgstr "极点表示为空三角箭头。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/line.rst
msgid "Circle"
msgstr "圆形"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/line.rst:74
msgid "The extreme point is represented as an empty circle."
msgstr "极点表示为空圆。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/line.rst
msgid "Diamond"
msgstr "钻石"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/line.rst:76
msgid "The extreme point is represented as an empty diamond."
msgstr "极点代表为空方块。"
